Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?luci-app-perenio:=20USSD=20=D0=BD=D0=B5=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D1=80=D0=B0=D0=B1=D0=BE=D1=82=D0=B0=D0=BB=20=D0=B8=D0=B7-?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=B7=D0=B0=20=D0=BE=D1=88=D0=B8=D0=B1=D0=BA=D0=B8=20stty?=
